# Playwright E2E — local-first, fail-closed backend contract
# =========================================================================
#
# Preferred entry point (no dotenv file required):
#
#     npm run test:e2e:local
#
# The local lifecycle (scripts/e2e-local.mjs) starts an ephemeral local
# Supabase stack, replays the tracked migrations, seeds deterministic
# local-only Auth identities + fixtures, and passes the generated
# credentials and the local public client configuration to Playwright
# **in memory**. You do NOT need to fill in this file for the normal path.
#
# Safety model
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# * Production-backed Playwright is prohibited. The pre-server guard
#   (Layer 1) refuses to start Vite unless the effective Supabase target is
#   a loopback local stack; the browser-runtime guard (Layer 2) re-checks
#   the origin the app actually loaded before any credential is entered.
# * The legacy Production/dedicated-account model (ps4 / ps5) MUST NOT be
#   used by the local path. Do not point these variables at a remote or
#   Production Supabase project.
# * The Supabase *publishable* (anon) client configuration is not a private
#   secret. Test **passwords** ARE sensitive — never commit them. The local
#   lifecycle generates a fresh ephemeral password each run and never writes
#   it to disk.
#
# Direct Playwright invocation (advanced / debugging only)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A bare `npm run test:e2e` fails closed. To drive Playwright directly you
# must supply the complete explicit local backend contract, e.g.:
#
#     E2E_BACKEND_MODE=local
#     E2E_EXPECTED_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
#     VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
#     VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=<local anon key from `supabase status`>
#     TEST_USER_EMAIL=<local .test user>
#     TEST_USER_PASSWORD=<local user password>
#
# Optional: override the application base URL. Must be a loopback origin in
# local mode. Defaults to http://localhost:8080 when unset.
# BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
